# Offline artifacts exercise the Report exit under a Review ceiling; no model calls.
name: Report discovery and export without entering Fix
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR
env: KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/revision_comparison.py @TMP_TARGET
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | shell-ready
submit: autonomy review
submit: tools phase:report
require-live-snap: 20 report:build | report-tools
expect: REPORT
expect: report:sarif
ask: Are reports discoverable as their own surface, with concrete export actions?
keys: Escape
submit: run report:build {"runId":"fixture-later"}
require-live-snap: 20 run receipt · completed | report-completed
expect: autonomy:review
expect-not: blocked by autonomy
expect-not: requires Fix
shell: test -s @TMP_TARGET/.kuzushi/v3/runs/fixture-later/report.md
submit: report
require-live-snap: 20 Workspace spend: total unavailable | report-exit
expect: phase:Map 1/5
ask: Does Report show evidence and honest coverage or empty states without requiring a Prove or Fix action?
keys: C-c
